{
  "name": "ELO — retrieve an envelope",
  "priority": 5,
  "request": {
    "method": "POST",
    "urlPath": "/enveloppe/recuperer",
    "headers": {
      "messageCode": {
        "equalTo": "ENV_REC01"
      }
    }
  },
  "response": {
    "status": 200,
    "headers": {
      "Content-Type": "application/json"
    },
    "transformers": [
      "response-template"
    ],
    "jsonBody": {
      "enveloppe": {
        "jeton": "EI202609271130001234A",
        "numeroDossier": "{{jsonPath request.body '$.numeroDossier'}}",
        "statut": "APPAIREE",
        "modeCreation": "EDI",
        "informationsAppairage": {
          "sensTraversee": "IMPORT",
          "typeCamion": "PLEIN",
          "estTIRATA": true,
          "possedeContratTransport": false,
          "estPostal": false,
          "estEmballageVide": false,
          "estSPS": false,
          "estProduitPeche": false
        },
        "declarations": [
          {
            "identifiant": "25FR17551780961AT5",
            "typeDeclaration": "ENS",
            "informationsValidation": {
              "etat": "CONFORME",
              "code": "RETOUR-OK",
              "message": ""
            }
          }
        ],
        "nombreDeclaration": 1,
        "dateCreation": "{{now offset='-1 hours'}}",
        "dateModification": "{{now offset='-30 minutes'}}",
        "dateValidation": "{{now offset='-15 minutes'}}",
        "aUneELOValide": true,
        "procedureSecoursIcs2": false,
        "pdf": ""
      }
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "comment": [
      "recupererENV returns the EnveloppeREC02 shape, which adds aUneELOValide (and",
      "optionally a base64 pdf) on top of the plain Enveloppe fields — this stub",
      "shows an envelope further along the lifecycle than the create/modify stubs:",
      "APPAIREE (paired to a physical crossing) with its declaration CONFORME, to",
      "demonstrate the full field set a caller can expect once customs has cleared",
      "it. numeroDossier is echoed back from the request (ENV_REC01 identifies the",
      "envelope that way); jeton/dates are fixed illustrative samples.",
      "To rehearse the 400 path, copy this file, change response.status to 400 and",
      "the jsonBody to the ENV_REC03 shape ({ numeroDossier, statut,",
      "libelleErreur }), then give it a higher priority and a narrower matcher.",
      "",
      "sensTraversee is IMPORT and estTIRATA true: UK to France is an arrival into the EU,",
      "and French Customs' guidance for emergency humanitarian aid to Ukraine is TIR/ATA",
      "without a transport contract (issue #24). The declaration is an ENS accordingly.",
      "These three stubs describe the same traffic, so they agree with each other."
    ]
  }
}
